' A2 — simple enum demo, test file.
' Each Assert calls the Public function DurationSec directly on the enum value.
' The enum is project-global, so we qualify it as TrafficLight.Red etc.
'
' NOTE: constants are Double, so comparisons with 0 need .0 or a Double variable.

Test "red light duration"
    Assert Traffic.DurationSec(TrafficLight.Red) = 30
End Test

Test "yellow light duration"
    Assert Traffic.DurationSec(TrafficLight.Yellow) = 5
End Test

Test "green light duration"
    Assert Traffic.DurationSec(TrafficLight.Green) = 45
End Test

Test "constants are positive"
    Assert Traffic.DefaultRedSec > 0.0
    Assert Traffic.DefaultYellowSec > 0.0
    Assert Traffic.DefaultGreenSec > 0.0
End Test
